z3 chains its region and stack pages through a header word holding the
previous page with a flag in bit 0, stored as a size_t, and the stack keeps
its marks (pointer | external flag) the same way. Under Fil-C the integer
store drops the capability, so region::~region() trapped in del_pages
(test-z3 -a, udoc_relation). Keep both as char * and set and clear the
flag with pointer arithmetic.

